  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong><a href=\"https://bankofindia.co.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Bank of India (BOI)</span></a></span> has recently published the notification for the recruitment of Apprentice Posts on the official website of BOI. This recruitment has been issued for 400 posts. Candidates Can Also Check All Details on Official , Online applying process for Bank of India Apprentice Online Form 2026 has Started from 25 December 2025 &amp; the candidates can apply till the 10 January 2026. Candidates must check the complete details for Bank of India Apprentice Online Form 2026 which has given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Bank of India (BOI)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Bank of India Apprentices Recruitment 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>23 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>25 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <s