laxation as per Bank of India Apprentice Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bank of India Apprentice 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 400 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.2135%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.4237%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>General&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 13.0947%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>EWS</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.5089%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>OBC</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.4365%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>SC</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.3229%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>ST</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.2135%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Apprentice</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.4237%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">195</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 13.0947%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">35</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.5089%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">78</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.4365%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">49</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 12.3229%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">43</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n